the data.\n\ndata is the original data.\n{S0, f, pdc} are the solution to a 2 \
compartment IVIM fit using IVIMCalc or BayesianIVIMFit2.\nbval are the \
bvalues.\n\nThe fraction is defined between 0 and 1, the pdc is in mm^2/s.\n\n\
output is the corrected data.", "Documentation" -> 
